🔁 Day 5 Logic Reused

One important goal of this project was to reuse something learned previously.

The temperature conversion from Day 5 has been incorporated into this larger menu-driven program:

if opt1 == 1:
    c = float(input("Enter Celsius:"))
    f = round((c * 9/5) + 32, 2)

and:

elif opt1 == 2:
    f = float(input("Enter Fahrenheit:"))
    c = round((f - 32) * 5/9, 2)

This demonstrates that you don't always need to write completely new logic—you can take logic you already understand and place it inside a bigger program.



